  "details": "Uhm uhhh Well there is a bug with the Vive controls, it's not like that on any other VR..\nSo when you use an animation on the trigger button (Fist- Closed hand) everything works fine, but if you let go a little bit the animation goes back to deafult and just stops working.\nMore precisely (A good example) ... If u put an animation on the trigger that closes the Avatars eyes, and you press it, then the eyes close, just like they're supposed to, but if you wanna trigger back, as in, go back to deafult mode letting go off the trigger, no matter how lightly you let go, you just go back to full open eyes (deafult)...\nI don't think that's normal, cuz why would it be if every other VR is fine when it comes to those animations.",
